OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,APope diagnosed with lung cancer but had
OL,4,Asuccessful surgery, Vatican says
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The operation was successful and there
OL,7,Fwere no complications," the Vatican
OL,8,Fsaid. "After the operation, the Pope
OL,9,Fawoke normally and returned after a
OL,10,Fbrief period of observation to his
OL,11,Froom."
OL,13,FThe pontiff had a "peaceful night" in
OL,14,Fthe hospital, the Vatican said on
OL,15,FWednesday morning, and he is expected
OL,16,Fto remain there for about a week.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
